{"version":1,"content":"<p>由韓星鄭容和與洪承希主演的Viu Original原創浪漫喜劇《不著邊際的你》，將於10月24日首播，故事講述韓流明星嚴泰峰（鄭容和飾）擁有出眾外貌、演技與明星光環，是公認的「愛情劇大師」；</p><p>然而他有致命矛盾：拒絕拍攝任何吻戲，背後隱藏著不為人知秘密！</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:04:05.640552+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":126,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T08:08:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T10:17:38.727265+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:57:40.684322+00:00","content_hash":"168f4205ce777e958c9dbc308220ff50fd6169631eebf84246fc7057bd0d1a36","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}